PASSAGES OF EXTRAORDINARY
MAGNITUDE
There is a 1-in-5 chance per level that the
dungeon extends beyond the border of the graph
paper. These passages can be as long as
desired. A full analysis of FFC has not been
completed. Suffice to say that a larger, deep and
lengthy set of tunnels and caverns may travel for
miles beneath the surface of the campaign world.
These may have been carved out by volcanic
action, ancient magic, alien technology, Ochre
Jellies, or Giant Wourmes.
